[I] K-system audio level meter for JACK

[T] Jkmeter is a horizontal or vertical bargraph audio level meter for JACK
[T] implementing the K-system metering proposed by mastering engineer Bob
[T] Katz, with K-20, K-14 and K-12 scales.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

[A] Kokkini Zita
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 0.9.0

[D] d61a64ce265dc6fda0342640ebfbf24560c9de6c73e6d47cf2402b18 jkmeter-0.9.0.tar.bz2 https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/downloads/

srcdir=*/source
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -c?:-L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libxft)
